&lt;p&gt;This is an individual contributor role for someone who enjoys rolling up their sleeves: managing multiple concurrent projects, orchestrating enhancements or building hands-on in tools like Salesforce, Tableau, Snowflake, and driving process improvements without a team behind them. You’ll bring independent judgment to how you get things done.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Program &amp;amp; Project Management&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Independently manage a portfolio of operational projects and initiatives for Global&amp;nbsp; Services Strategy &amp;amp; Operations, balancing multiple short- and mid-term priorities at once.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous asks from stakeholders and cross-functional partners into clear project plans, timelines, and success criteria.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Keep initiatives on track by coordinating across Sales, Customer Success, Support, Partners, IT, and Product — flagging risks and proposing solutions before they become blockers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Process &amp;amp; Systems Ownership&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build, document, and maintain the systems and automations that support services reporting, alerting, and workflow needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to streamline manual or error-prone processes and design more scalable, repeatable solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own documentation for operational processes so they’re auditable and easy to hand off or scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Reporting &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the development and upkeep of operational metrics and dashboards (e.g., attach rate, pipeline, resourcing, service delivery health) that inform PS Operations and leadership decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with analysts and stakeholders to ensure the data feeding these reports is accurate and timely.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a go-to point of coordination for internal and external partners solving problems that span multiple functional areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evangelize new tools, processes, and ways of working across PS, Sales, and CS stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain relationships that create coordination across groups, both internal and external (e.g., implementation partners).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4–6 years of experience in professional services operations, program/project management, revenue operations, or a related operational role, ideally in a fast-paced SaaS or technology company.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to independently manage multiple concurrent projects and shifting priorities, exercising sound judgment on how to drive results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with systems like Salesforce, Tableau, Google Sheets/Apps Script, Zapier, or similar automation and reporting tools. SQL experience is a plus.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical and problem-solving skills–comfortable evaluating ambiguous situations and data to design creative, effective solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communicator who builds trust with stakeholders across functions and levels, from individual contributors to leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A builder’s mindset: energized by creating new approaches, processes, and tools rather than only maintaining existing ones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
