&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the Team and Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a versatile Product Marketing Lead—a true Swiss Army knife—to join our K:Marketing PMM team. In this role, you’ll tackle SMS and Mobile Messaging, a premier strategic growth engine for Klaviyo and a critical component of our flagship marketing automation platform. Mobile communication—spanning SMS, MMS, push notifications, and emerging channels—is no longer an add-on; it is a foundational pillar of modern omnichannel commerce and a top priority driving revenue growth across our entire customer base.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll serve as the dedicated PMM partner for our Klaviyo SMS &amp;amp; Mobile product team, understanding market opportunities, deciphering the evolving mobile compliance landscape, analyzing competitive dynamics, and directly influencing our product roadmap. You will lead global product launches, rallying cross-functional stakeholders to execute comprehensive go-to-market strategies that accelerate adoption, expand global carrier coverage, and establish mobile as an indispensable, high-ROI channel for brands worldwide. You’ll leverage the momentum of Klaviyo’s trusted platform while driving the zero-to-one messaging strategy for new mobile innovations— mastering product-market fit, and unlocking high-velocity revenue growth.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you thrive in a fast-paced, high-growth environment, and want to show the world how real-time, hyper-personalized mobile experiences power modern customer relationships, this role is built for you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Positioning &amp;amp; Storytelling:&lt;/strong&gt; Define the value proposition, messaging hierarchy, and positioning for Klaviyo’s SMS and Mobile product suite.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GTM &amp;amp; Product Launches:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Drive end-to-end go-to-market strategies across Sales, Customer Success, Enablement, and Growth Marketing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market &amp;amp; Competitive Intelligence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Track global mobile trends to position Klaviyo as the most trusted, compliant, and powerful mobile marketing solution on the market.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Roadmap Evangelization &amp;amp; Influence:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Partner closely with Product Management to champion customer needs, surface market gaps, and synthesize feedback.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Adoption &amp;amp; Revenue Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop targeted campaigns, ROI models, and cross-sell playbooks to enable merchants to scale seamlessly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sales Enablement &amp;amp; Deal Support:&lt;/strong&gt; Build essential GTM assets (pitch decks, one-pagers, ROI calculators, enablement trainings) as a mobile Subject Matter Expert (SME) with sales.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Perform other related duties as assigned to support the overall objectives of the K:Marketing PMM organization and the mobile business unit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of experience in B2B SaaS product marketing roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Marketing tech experience and or e-commerce is a huge plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Know what great work looks like – bringing in new product intro frameworks and playbooks for our team, while knowing when to create our own playbook to move fast&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Have examples of great positioning and messaging that cut through the noise and differentiated your product or service&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love and thrive in a fast-paced, dynamic environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
