&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Klaviyo, we&#39;re Built Different: a company of builders who take ownership, operate with candor, and believe we&#39;re 1% done. That extends to how we tell our own story, both inside and out.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We&#39;re seeking a Senior Employer Brand Specialist to own recruitment marketing execution across every channel candidates meet us in: social, our career site, and job boards. You&#39;ll bring Klaviyo&#39;s employer brand narrative to life in the channels that matter for hiring – turning strategy defined by our Internal Communications team into campaigns, content, and a career site experience that actually convert.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports into the Internal Communications team and partners closely with them on Klaviyo&#39;s broader employer brand narrative. You own bringing that story to candidates: the channels, the campaigns, and the performance behind them. You&#39;ll also be the person with the closest read on the market and our own hiring funnel, and you&#39;ll use that to help shape what the team writes about next, not just execute what&#39;s already decided.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We need someone who&#39;s built recruitment marketing or employer brand programs before and can set the operating model, not just run one someone else has already defined.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is an experienced recruitment marketer who&#39;s comfortable owning a budget and vendor relationships, producing content and lightweight design work, and using performance data to sharpen what&#39;s working. You&#39;ll have real latitude to run channels and a budget, and you&#39;ll be looked to for judgment on how this function should operate day to day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You&#39;ll Make a Difference&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own recruitment marketing strategy execution across channels: social, career site, and job boards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring an established point of view on how recruitment marketing should run here, since this function is new to the team. Set the operating rhythm rather than waiting for one to be defined for you.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze what&#39;s happening in the market and within Talent Acquisition — hiring trends, candidate sentiment, competitive employer brand moves, and funnel data — and partner with the internal communications and experience teams to help shape what we write about and when.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Govern the career site: content, job distribution, page performance, and analytics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Execute paid social and recruitment ad campaigns across LinkedIn, job boards, and other targeted channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce recruitment marketing content: video, social, and candidate-facing storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and produce quick-turn ad creative and social assets in-house — banners, social graphics, simple video/motion edits, so most day-to-day recruitment marketing needs don&#39;t have to route through our brand agency partners. Loop in the brand agency for larger or more complex creative work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyze recruitment marketing metrics and campaign performance, and refine strategy accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the recruitment marketing budget and channel vendor relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own job posting strategy and optimization across all channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with the internal communications and experience teams to translate Klaviyo&#39;s employer brand narrative into recruitment marketing execution that stays consistent with the broader story, while surfacing market and funnel insight that informs what that narrative should be.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Talent Acquisition on funnel performance, req-level needs, and hiring priorities to keep recruitment marketing aligned with what TA actually needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with the internal communications and experience teams on career site content updates and consistency with other comms channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in recruitment marketing, employer brand, or performance marketing, including having built or run a recruitment marketing function from the ground up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A sharp read on the market and the hiring funnel, comfortable pulling signal from hiring trends, candidate feedback, and competitive employer brand moves, and turning that into concrete content ideas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable owning a budget and vendor relationships independently, with a track record of doing so.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong content producer who can create or direct video, social, and candidate-facing storytelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working design skills, comfortable in tools like Figma, Canva, or Adobe Express to quickly produce clean, on-brand ad creative and social assets without always needing to route through a brand or design agency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-literate: you read campaign and funnel performance and use it to make real decisions, not just report numbers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear communicator who can both take direction on narrative and bring your own point of view to what that narrative should cover next.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable operating with real autonomy and minimal oversight, since this is a new function for the team you&#39;re joining. You&#39;ll be defining as much as executing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with GSuite and Slack required; experience with career site platforms, ad platforms (LinkedIn Campaign Manager, job board ad tools), lightweight design tools, and content production tools preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$108,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$162,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
