&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo&#39;s operational infrastructure, built and managed by our GTM Systems team, powers our GTM engine. We&#39;re looking for a Senior GTM Architect, a technical expert with end-to-end understanding of the systems behind marketing, sales, and customer experience, who can reimagine how that system works with an AI-first approach, and who is hands-on enough to build, ship, and de-risk the hardest parts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our GTM Systems team sits at the center of Klaviyo&#39;s GTM engine, powering the operational infrastructure that connects marketing, sales, partnerships, and customer success. We build and own the systems that enable our teams to move quickly, trust their data, and focus on what matters most: helping our customers grow. As we scale, we&#39;re rebuilding the marketing, sales, and CX stack around agentic AI as the operating model, not a bolt-on experiment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As the Senior GTM Architect, you are the domain expert for how Klaviyo&#39;s marketing, sales, and customer experience systems work together and how they should work differently once AI agents, not just dashboards and workflows, are doing meaningful parts of the job. You own the architecture across our CRM (Salesforce), marketing automation, sales engagement, data enrichment, and CS/support platforms. You translate ambiguous GTM strategy into system architecture (data models, integration patterns, agentic workflows), drive the roadmap by looking around the corner with GTM leadership, and stay hands-on to build and ship meaningful parts of the solution yourself, not just diagram it from a distance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of the breadth of this remit, you&#39;ll regularly present architecture decisions and AI transformation strategy directly to senior GTM, RevOps, and executive leadership, and need to influence outcomes well above your reporting line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you&#39;ll make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own end-to-end GTM systems architecture: &lt;/strong&gt;Salesforce, marketing automation, sales engagement, data enrichment, and CS/support platforms, ensuring seamless integration and clean, bidirectional data flow across marketing, sales, and customer success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ship AI agents into production, not pilots: &lt;/strong&gt;build and deploy agentic workflows replacing manual GTM work with intelligent, auditable automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Redesign core GTM processes around AI: &lt;/strong&gt;lead-to-revenue, opportunity management, renewals/expansion, and support handoffs, evaluating and piloting AI-native tools rather than just administering the existing stack.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stay hands-on: &lt;/strong&gt;architect and ship meaningful pieces of the solution yourself (Apex, LWC, SOQL, integrations, AI orchestration layers), track your work transparently, and set the technical bar through code review and pairing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Establish data quality and governance standards &lt;/strong&gt;that keep GTM data trustworthy at scale, and build the reporting infrastructure that leadership relies on to make decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Serve as the go-to domain expert and trusted advisor &lt;/strong&gt;to Marketing, Sales, RevOps, CX, and senior/executive leadership translating complex architectural and AI tradeoffs into language that drives decisions in the room, not just documentation after the fact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mentor engineers and GTM Systems teammates &lt;/strong&gt;on system design, AI-native workflow design, and technical tradeoff thinking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What makes you a great fit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ve been the technical decision-maker for a complex, multi-system GTM platform (Salesforce or similar) spanning more than one function: marketing, sales, and/or customer success. You are&amp;nbsp; able to both design the architecture and build meaningful parts of it yourself, hands-on with Apex, LWC, Flow, and integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience designing and building agentic AI/LLM-powered workflows for real business problems, and a clear, defensible point of view on where AI should replace human judgment in GTM workflows and where it shouldn&#39;t.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can translate ambiguous, cross-functional business problems (marketing, sales, CX, revenue operations) into a technical solution and a clear set of tradeoffs, then explain your reasoning to engineers and business stakeholders alike.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You operate with a high degree of autonomy and influence: given a fuzzy, high-visibility problem, you can drive it from discovery through design through delivery, and you&#39;re comfortable being the person senior and executive leadership turns to for a straight answer.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a track record of raising the bar for a team&#39;s engineering practice through code review, GitHub-based workflows, and technical mentorship,&amp;nbsp; even when you&#39;re the most senior technical voice in the room.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nice to haves&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Salesforce Application Architect, System Architect, or similar architect-track certification (or equivalent demonstrated experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with LLM/agent frameworks (LangChain, CrewAI, LlamaIndex, Agentforce, or similar) and deploying them into production environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with the broader GTM tooling ecosystem, conversation intelligence (Gong), marketing automation (HubSpot), customer success (Gainsight) and data enrichment (ZoomInfo/Clearbit/Clay) and how each integrates with a CRM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with vector databases and RAG patterns for grounding AI agents in GTM and CRM knowledge.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience at a high-growth software company supporting marketing, sales, and CX systems together not just a single function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why this role matters at Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is not a purely strategic, diagrams-only architect role. Klaviyo&#39;s GTM Systems function is actively shifting its engineering standard toward pro-code, GitHub-based development and AI-assisted, agentic workflows across marketing, sales, and CX. You&#39;ll both set that direction and help build it. Here&#39;s what makes it worth your time:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your architecture decisions and your code directly affect how Klaviyo generates, converts, and retains revenue&amp;nbsp; you own enough of both the design and the build to know it holds up.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll have a broader canvas than a single-function systems role: marketing, sales, and CX are yours to architect as one system, not three.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;ll help define what an AI-first GTM operating model looks like at Klaviyo establishing standards and practices that outlast any single sprint, and that leadership adopts because you made the case.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$164,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$246,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Get to Know Klaviyo&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re Klaviyo (pronounced clay-vee-oh). We empower creators to own their destiny by making first-party data accessible and actionable like never before. We see limitless potential for the technology we’re developing to nurture personalized experiences in ecommerce and beyond. To reach our goals, we need our own crew of remarkable creators—ambitious and collaborative teammates who stay focused on our north star: delighting our customers. If you’re ready to do the best work of your career, where you’ll be welcomed as your whole self from day one and supported with generous benefits, we hope you’ll join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;AI fluency at Klaviyo includes responsible use of AI (including privacy, security, bias awareness, and human-in-the-loop). We provide accommodations as needed.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;By participating in Klaviyo’s interview process, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and will adhere to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/careers/ai-guidance&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw0auUcRqeYRczM9UoXAKldj&quot;&gt;Guidelines for using AI in the Klaviyo interview Process&lt;/a&gt;. For more information about how we process your personal data, see our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-saferedirecturl=&quot;https://www.google.com/url?q=https://www.klaviyo.com/legal/job-applicant-privacy-notice&amp;amp;source=gmail&amp;amp;ust=1761072778777000&amp;amp;usg=AOvVaw1axMoReIM1qwTbmaPcLI_b&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Klaviyo is committed to a policy of equal opportunity and non-discrimination. We do not discriminate on the basis of race, ethnicity, citizenship, national origin, color, religion or religious creed, age, sex (including pregnancy), gender identity, sexual orientation, physical or mental disability, veteran or active military status, marital status, criminal record, genetics, retaliation, sexual harassment or any other characteristic protected by applicable law.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
