&lt;p&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the different backgrounds, experiences, and perspectives that each Klaviyo brings to work. If you are close, but not an exact match, we hope you will still apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;About the team&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Identity and Access Management (IAM) controls how people, services, integrations, and AI agents access Klaviyo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We build authentication and authorization for users, agents, and machines that access the Klaviyo platform.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a chance to solve hard identity problems that affect nearly every part of our product.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Software Engineer, you will lead complex projects across several components while staying hands-on with the software. You will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead business-critical projects from design through launch and long-term operation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build secure, reliable services for authentication, authorization, delegation, auditing, and revocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Break ambiguous problems into clear work that several engineers can deliver together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the customer impact, reliability, and technical quality of your work in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the architecture of your area as scale, security, and product needs change.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define and maintain SLOs for the systems that you own.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Security, Product, Platform, and product engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create reusable patterns that make IAM easier and safer for other teams to adopt.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor engineers and help project contributors succeed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Apply new engineering and AI tools responsibly, then share what you learn with the team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take on important unowned work that helps the team move faster.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you are&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience building and operating production software.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience developing production services in Go or Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with authentication, authorization, identity, or related security systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have built networking systems, API gateways, APIs, or SDKs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have led complex projects that spanned multiple engineers and several months.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You take end-to-end ownership and stay with your work after launch.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You communicate clearly, work well across teams, and make practical technical decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You mentor other engineers and raise the quality bar through feedback and example.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You balance long-term improvements with steady customer delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Nice to have&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with auth or policy systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building secure platforms used by other engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with AWS, Terraform, Kubernetes, React, or Django.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with enterprise security, auditability, data residency, or compliance needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You do not need to know every part of our stack on day one. We care most about strong judgment, ownership, and care for the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
