&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Klaviyo, we value the unique backgrounds, experiences and perspectives each Klaviyo (we call ourselves Klaviyos) brings to our workplace each and every day. We believe everyone deserves a fair shot at success and appreciate the experiences each person brings beyond the traditional job requirements. If you’re a close but not exact match with the description, we hope you’ll still consider applying. Want to learn more about life at Klaviyo? Visit &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;http://klaviyo.com/careers&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;klaviyo.com/careers&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;to see how we empower creators to own their own destiny.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Klaviyo is seeking an AI Solutions Architect to accelerate how our Global Services organization leverages AI to operate smarter and deliver more impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits at the intersection of applied AI, solutions architecture, and internal enablement. We&#39;re looking for a strong technical problem solver who can quickly turn business challenges into practical AI solutions while collaborating across technical and non-technical teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll build AI-powered solutions that solve both creative and operational challenges. Your work will span accelerating content creation, enabling smarter learning experiences, connecting internal data sources, and automating workflows that improve efficiency and decision-making.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You&#39;ll also help teams use tools like Claude, ChatGPT, and Glean more effectively by building skills, prompts, and AI workflows that are reliable, reusable, and aligned to real business needs. As solutions grow in complexity, you&#39;ll help facilitate the evolution of workflows and prototypes into production-grade systems, working closely with Klaviyo&#39;s centralized AI engineering team and leveraging their support to scale larger, cross-functional initiatives.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within the Strategy &amp;amp; Operations team and serves as connective tissue across the broader Services organization, helping identify high-impact opportunities, accelerate experimentation, and scale successful AI solutions across the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How You’ll Make a Difference:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Program Strategy &amp;amp; Discovery&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Services leaders to identify high impact areas that could benefit from AI or automation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prioritize opportunities based on efficiency gains and impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate ambiguous ideas into clear program roadmaps with defined outcomes and milestones&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Prototyping &amp;amp; Productization&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build AI-powered prototypes and workflows using Claude, LLMs, and modern AI development platforms to rapidly validate business solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and connect AI systems using APIs, MCPs, automation platforms, and internal data sources to create intelligent, end-to-end workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand how to integrate AI solutions with existing systems, collaborating with engineering teams when production-grade implementations are needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop effective prompts, skills, agents, and retrieval workflows that improve the quality, reliability, and usefulness of AI-generated outputs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Evaluate and iterate on AI solutions using user feedback, business outcomes, and emerging best practices to drive adoption and impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Enablement &amp;amp; AI Literacy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clear documentation, implementation guides, and best practices that enable teams to effectively build and adopt AI solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead enablement sessions, workshops, and office hours to grow AI fluency and help teams build effective prompts, skills, agents, and workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on emerging AI capabilities, tools, and best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who You Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A systems thinker with a strong technical foundation and a passion for solving business problems with AI.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experienced building AI-powered prototypes using LLMs and modern AI tools, with an understanding of APIs and system integrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong communicator who can translate technical concepts, create clear documentation, and enable others to adopt AI effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable partnering with engineering teams to scale successful solutions into production when needed.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Preferred skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in AI solutions, solutions architecture, internal tooling, automation, or similar technical roles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building solutions with Claude or other leading LLM platforms, including prompt engineering, skills, agents, and AI workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience integrating AI with APIs, internal systems, or data sources to solve business problems and improve team workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to rapidly prototype, test, and iterate on AI-powered solutions based on user feedback and business needs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with Global Services functions, such as onboarding, education, consulting, or customer success is a plus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Massachusetts Applicants:&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;It is unlawful in Massachusetts to require or administer a lie detector test as a condition of employment or continued employment. An employer who violates this law shall be subject to criminal penalties and civil liability.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our salary range reflects the cost of labor across various U.S. geographic markets. The range displayed below reflects the minimum and maximum target salaries for the position across all our US locations. The base salary offered for this position is determined by several factors, including the applicant’s job-related skills, relevant experience, education or training, and work location.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In addition to base salary, our total compensation package may include participation in the company’s annual cash bonus plan, variable compensation (OTE) for sales and customer success roles, equity, sign-on payments, and a comprehensive range of health, welfare, and wellbeing benefits based on eligibility.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your recruiter can provide more details about the specific salary/OTE range for your preferred location during the hiring process.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Pay Range For US Locations:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$112,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$168,000 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;This role may require up to 10% travel for purposes such as new hire onboarding, client or partner work if applicable, team meetings, and industry events. Travel is coordinated in advance.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
